COLLECT FROM ALL RELEVANT EVIDENCE STREAMS, INCLUDING:

- SAT/H(s)H public-release chronology;
- podcast publication dates and transcript contents;
- podcast statistics and audience analytics;
- GitHub/archive publication and traffic records;
- clone, visitor, referrer, view, indexing, and acquisition records;
- Google Trends and other search data;
- news coverage;
- external scientific publications;
